      <p class="mt-6 flex items-start gap-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 11v5M12 8h.01"/></svg>
        As notas podem variar com hospedagem, scripts de terceiros e conteúdo inserido depois da entrega.
